#   * Tile the spatial dimension i to improve cache/TLB locality.
#   * Further split and fully unroll the innermost loop to reduce loop
#     overhead and expose straight-line code to the backend compiler.
#   * Parallelize the outer spatial tiles with OpenMP via parallelize_loop.
